IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-RVV-PREFETCH.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-CACHELINES    PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 PREFETCH-DIST       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 HIT-RATE-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X100        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-RVV-PREF.
    IF TOTAL-CACHELINES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 98 TO HIT-RATE-PCT.
    MOVE 215 TO SPEEDUP-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOTAL-CACHELINES.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
